Role-Based Access Control (RBAC) with Spring Security
Spring Boot 3 + Maven + H2 Database + Spring Data JPA + Spring Security
Objective
To extend the Spring Security configuration for role-based authorization: users are stored in H2 with
BCrypt-encoded passwords and roles ADMIN or USER, and endpoints are restricted with method-level
security (@EnableMethodSecurity + @PreAuthorize).
